":"in the rain. This is the Sao Paulo Grand"},{"t0":10.44,"t1":11.82,"text":"Prix in data."},{"t0":14.66,"t1":17.54,"text":"71 laps around Interlagos. Rain at the"},{"t0":17.56,"t1":20.32,"text":"start, rain at the end, and about 16 degrees"},{"t0":20.34,"t1":22.78,"text":"in the air. And here's the strange part,"},{"t0":22.92,"t1":25.62,"text":"not a single safety car, not even a virtual"},{"t0":25.64,"t1":26.28,"text":"one."},{"t0":29.37,"t1":31.77,"text":"Lando Norris started on pole. By the end"},{"t0":31.79,"t1":34.849999999999994,"text":"of lap one, he was third. Kimi Antonelli,"},{"t0":34.87,"t1":36.83,"text":"the new world champion, went straight into"},{"t0":36.85,"t1":38.769999999999996,"text":"the lead, with Liam Lawson right behind"},{"t0":38.79,"t1":39.41,"text":"him."},{"t0":41.81,"t1":44.17,"text":"Antonelli led the first 19 laps."},{"t0":44.57,"t1":46.65,"text":"On lap 20, Norris took it back."},{"t0":47.17,"t1":49.07,"text":"Antonelli led again for four laps during"},{"t0":49.09,"t1":51.11,"text":"the second round of stops. And from lap"},{"t0":51.13,"t1":55.35,"text":"54, the race was Norris's. 48 laps led."},{"t0":55.85,"t1":57.23,"text":"23 for Antonelli."},{"t0":59.92,"t1":62.44,"text":"The podium all made the same three calls."},{"t0":63.0,"t1":64.8,"text":"Intermediate at the start, slicks around"},{"t0":64.82,"t1":67.54,"text":"lap 17, and back to intermediates on lap"},{"t0":67.56,"t1":69.9,"text":"63 when the rain came back."},{"t0":72.36,"t1":74.86,"text":"Now, Verstappen, back of the grid after"},{"t0":74.88,"t1":78.22,"text":"a power unit penalty, 13th after 1 lap,"},{"t0":78.4,"t1":82.36,"text":"7th by lap 5, 3rd by lap 25 and 2nd at"},{"t0":82.38,"t1":85.22,"text":"the flag, just over 14 seconds behind Norris,"},{"t0":85.58,"t1":86.78,"text":"19 places."},{"t0":91.6,"t1":94.18,"text":"Norris wins. Verstappen second,"},{"t0":94.2,"t1":96.82000000000001,"text":"Isack Hadjar 3rd for Red Bull, and the fastest"},{"t0":96.84,"t1":101.54,"text":"lap, Antonelli, a 1:12.689 on lap 55."},{"t0":105.17,"t1":107.99,"text":"After the race, two five second penalties."},{"t0":108.51,"t1":109.93,"text":"Charles Leclerc, for the collision with"},{"t0":109.95,"t1":112.53,"text":"Lawson, he drops to eighth, Lawson moves"},{"t0":112.55,"t1":115.05,"text":"up to seventh. Antonelli, for an unsafe"},{"t0":115.07,"t1":116.83,"text":"release, he keeps fifth."},{"t0":119.88,"t1":122.1,"text":"And this result sealed something bigger."},{"t0":122.72,"t1":124.52,"text":"Mercedes are Constructors' Champions,"},{"t0":125.08,"t1":127.14,"text":"their 9th title, and their first since"},{"t0":127.16,"t1":128.28,"text":"2021."},{"t0":132.33,"t1":135.57,"text":"every F1 session in data. I'm Ismael,"},{"t0":135.77,"t1":138.03,"text":"this is PaddockIntel. Subscribe and I'll"},{"t0":138.05,"t1":139.19,"text":"see you in Las Vegas."}]}}